        <item>
            <title>0.2.12</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:19:23 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.12</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.12</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- New **Redact** tool (R) for hiding parts of screenshots. Drag a box of any size, or paint, to cover it in chunky pixel blocks or a solid colour.
- Pixelated blocks are shuffled by default, so the hidden text can't be reconstructed, while it still looks like ordinary pixelation.
- Redactions go on their own "Redactions" layer above the screenshot. Share an exported or flattened copy, since the layered file still contains the original.
]]></description>
